cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FactorFoundry in academic work, please cite this repository."
title: "FactorFoundry: an auditable multi-agent research lab for alpha discovery"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "FactorFoundry contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zdxslwywfccsqk/FactorFoundry"
license: MIT
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-22"
abstract: >-
  FactorFoundry is an open-source multi-agent research lab that turns economic
  hypotheses into reproducible, leakage-audited alpha experiments. Language-model
  agents propose and critique while deterministic tools compute, audit, and lock
  the holdout.
